olset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The flight F100 went through (reservation R0001, confirmed), but the hotel didn't. Retrying `book_trip` would run the flight booking again, so I'll book only the hotel.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Lq6WQZX9CBeVFR3qzmRi5o", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-h1-2026-11-12-2n-hotel-only"}, "name": "book_hotel", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UNYrtmnGR8aBTVhKrNCbSZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Dana's trip is booked, but the flight and hotel were booked separately, not through `book_trip`, because that call timed out partway through.\n\n- **Flight:** F100, nonstop SFO\u2192JFK on 2026-11-12, $289 (reservation R0001, confirmed).\n- **Hotel:** Midtown Lodge (H1), check-in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights, $189/night, $378 total (reservation R0002, confirmed).\n- **Total:** $667 on the corporate card. That is under the $1,000 threshold, so no manager approval was needed.\n\nThe flight was already confirmed when the timeout happened, so I booked only the hotel to avoid charging for the flight twice. The result is the same as a single trip booking.", "type": "text"}]}]}